RQ2 9.2 round 2 (Tier 1, ML_Options.md) - strong baselines and probabilistic forecasts.
Rolling origin, expanding window, refit every 3 months (weekly 12); test from 2021-01-01; errors in EUR/MWh on the common rows of all point models and baselines.
Models: LEAR (LASSO), LightGBM quantile, CatBoost MultiQuantile, Quantile Regression Forest, SVR (RBF); quantiles 05, 10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 70, 80, 90, 95; seeds 3; LEAR target delta.
Hyperparameter search: 20 configurations per model (config 0 = round-2 defaults, rest random draws), re-tuned every 12 months; validation auto: full time-series CV (5 splits) for series with <= 5,000 blocks, else last 20% of the window; score = mean pinball at 10/50/90 % (SVR: MAE); LEAR: LassoCV over 20 alphas on the same split(s); QRF tuned with 100 trees.
lgbm_l1 = round-1 LightGBM (rq2_2_delta), merged for comparison.

